{
  "_": "Overture stage one: the first approach. NPC side only - the player's half is an open question (N-5) and does not block this. Selected by the NPC's persona (R-7), the register the player chose, and whether the room is public (N-3).",
  "registers": {
    "offer": "caps, a gift, something material",
    "charm": "fancy words, patience, a compliment",
    "blunt": "crude, direct, explicit",
    "linger": "say little, stay, simply be present"
  },
  "lands_on": {
    "mercantile": "offer",
    "romantic": "charm",
    "vulgar": "blunt",
    "reticent": "linger"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_greet_01",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "text": "Something you need, or are you just browsing?",
      "chars": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_greet_02",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "text": "If you are buying, then I am listening.",
      "chars": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_greet_01",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "text": "Well now. Look who found their way over here.",
      "chars": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_greet_02",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "text": "I was hoping somebody interesting would walk past.",
      "chars": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_greet_01",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "text": "You going to keep staring at my tits, or say something?",
      "chars": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_greet_02",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "text": "Come to talk, or come to fuck? Only one of those interests me.",
      "chars": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_greet_01",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "text": "Oh. Hello. Did you need something from me?",
      "chars": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_greet_02",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "stage": 0,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "text": "I did not see you standing there. Sorry.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_offer_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Now that is how you open a conversation.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_offer_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "You have my attention, and that does not come cheap.",
      "chars": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Pretty words. What are they going to cost me?",
      "chars": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That is very nice. Now tell me what you actually want.",
      "chars": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Direct. I respect it. I am still not moved.",
      "chars": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You could have led with an offer instead of that.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You can stand there all day if you like. It is free.",
      "chars": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Are you waiting for me to name you a price?",
      "chars": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You think I can be bought? That is almost insulting.",
      "chars": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Keep your caps and say something worth hearing.",
      "chars": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_charm_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Say that again, and slower this time.",
      "chars": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_charm_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Nobody has talked to me like that in years.",
      "chars": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That is certainly one way to ruin a moment.",
      "chars": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You could at least have worked up to it.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You are very quiet. Say something to me.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "I would much rather you used actual words.",
      "chars": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Caps? I was hoping you wanted to fuck, not shop.",
      "chars": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Put your money away and tell me what you want to do to me.",
      "chars": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "All that talk and you still have not said the word fuck once.",
      "chars": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Very pretty. Now say the filthy version and mean it.",
      "chars": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_blunt_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Finally. Somebody who says fuck like it is not a swear word.",
      "chars": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_blunt_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Say that again slower. I want to picture all of it.",
      "chars": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Standing there quiet is not going to get my legs open.",
      "chars": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You have got a mouth. Use it for words or use it on me.",
      "chars": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "I do not want anything. Thank you, though.",
      "chars": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Please do not. I would not know what to say.",
      "chars": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That is a great many words and I have none back.",
      "chars": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You really should not say things like that to me.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "I am going to pretend that I did not hear that.",
      "chars": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That is... no. Not like that, please.",
      "chars": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_linger_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "You are still here. Most people are not.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_linger_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "I do not mind you standing there. That is new.",
      "chars": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_recoil_01",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "Not in front of the stall. Have some sense.",
      "chars": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_mercantile_recoil_02",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "Say that somewhere nobody is counting my caps.",
      "chars": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_recoil_01",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "Here? With all these people? Absolutely not.",
      "chars": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_romantic_recoil_02",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "You have picked the worst possible room for that.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_recoil_01",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "I want your hands on me and there are twelve people watching.",
      "chars": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_vulgar_recoil_02",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "Say that again somewhere with a door. Loud as you like, then.",
      "chars": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_recoil_01",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "People can hear you. Please stop talking.",
      "chars": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "ov_reticent_recoil_02",
      "kind": "recoil",
      "stage": 1,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "recoil",
      "text": "Not here. Not with everybody watching us.",
      "chars": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_offer_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "You keep raising the price and I keep saying yes.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_offer_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Now we are negotiating properly.",
      "chars": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Still words. Lovely ones, but still only words.",
      "chars": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You are very good at this. I am still waiting.",
      "chars": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You could simply have made me an offer instead.",
      "chars": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Blunt is cheap. Try something expensive.",
      "chars": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Standing closer is not the same as offering me something.",
      "chars": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_mercantile_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "mercantile",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You are taking up my whole afternoon for free.",
      "chars": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "More caps. Is that genuinely all you have got?",
      "chars": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You keep reaching for your pocket instead of your words.",
      "chars": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_charm_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Keep going. Nobody has said anything like that to me in years.",
      "chars": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_charm_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "You are going to talk me into something, you know.",
      "chars": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You were doing so well right up until you said that.",
      "chars": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That was a step backwards and I think you know it.",
      "chars": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You are close enough to say something, so say it.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_romantic_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "romantic",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Silence is not the same thing as romance.",
      "chars": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Caps again? I do not want paying, I want fucking.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Put it away and tell me where you want your hands.",
      "chars": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Beautiful. Completely useless. Say the filthy version.",
      "chars": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Less poetry. More detail, and use the ugly words.",
      "chars": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_blunt_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Keep talking and I will have you against that wall.",
      "chars": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_blunt_land_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "Filthy mouth. I want it on me before you use it again.",
      "chars": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_linger_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Breathing at me is not foreplay. Say something filthy.",
      "chars": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_vulgar_linger_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "vulgar",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Still nothing? My own hand is more decisive than you are.",
      "chars": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_offer_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You do not have to give me things. I would rather you did not.",
      "chars": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_offer_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "offer",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That makes it feel like a transaction, and it is not.",
      "chars": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_charm_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "You are saying rather a lot and I cannot keep up with it.",
      "chars": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_charm_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "charm",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "Please slow down. I do not know what to do with that.",
      "chars": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_blunt_miss_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "That is a great deal faster than I am able to move.",
      "chars": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_blunt_miss_02",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "blunt",
      "outcome": "miss",
      "text": "I am not ready for you to say things like that to me.",
      "chars": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "ov2_reticent_linger_land_01",
      "kind": "response",
      "stage": 2,
      "persona": "reticent",
      "register": "linger",
      "outcome": "land",
      "text": "You are still here, and I have stopped wanting you to go.",
      "chars": 57
    },
